comments.body:
In the python case, you need the xformers wheel installed.

@bhack, it sounds like what you're asking for is for us to include the custom op code directly into the model.so.

I think we should add support for this mode of operation. However, this would likely require a step where AOTI needs the source code of the custom op and compiles it into the model.so. Do you think that's fine?
